<title>UK: Hanson finishes sale of Peabody to Energy.</title>
<headline>Hanson finishes sale of Peabody to Energy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Hanson Plc said on Friday it had completed the $1.64 billion sale of Peabody Holding Co Inc to its recently-demerged Energy Group Plc.</p>
<p>The sale was the final transaction involved in the demerger of the Energy Group from Hanson. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
